  (57, $t57a$Pro capstone 3: build core pieces$t57a$, $t57b$Animate the main pieces.$t57b$, $t57c$Animate the hero piece and one variant.$t57c$, $t57d$Pro capstone 3: build core pieces$t57d$, $t57e$Submit links.

**Sharing:** upload the animation and paste the link. Animation is checked by a person.$t57e$, $t57f$[{"criterion": "Craft", "max_points": 45, "guidance": "Polished."}, {"criterion": "On system", "max_points": 30, "guidance": "Consistent."}, {"criterion": "Technical", "max_points": 25, "guidance": "Right formats."}]$t57f$::jsonb, 120, 'text', false, false),
  (58, $t58a$Pro capstone 4: variants, sound and accessibility$t58a$, $t58b$Complete the set.$t58b$, $t58c$Produce remaining formats with sound, captions and reduced-motion versions.$t58c$, $t58d$Pro capstone 4: variants, sound and accessibility$t58d$, $t58e$Submit links and accessibility notes.

**Sharing:** upload the animation and paste the link. Animation is checked by a person.$t58e$, $t58f$[{"criterion": "Set complete", "max_points": 35, "guidance": "All pieces."}, {"criterion": "Accessibility", "max_points": 35, "guidance": "Done."}, {"criterion": "Sound", "max_points": 30, "guidance": "Clear."}]$t58f$::jsonb, 100, 'text', false, false),
  (59, $t59a$Pro capstone 5: critique and rights$t59a$, $t59b$Improve and clear.$t59b$, $t59c$Collect critique, revise and finish the licence log.$t59c$, $t59d$Pro capstone 5: critique and rights$t59d$, $t59e$Submit critique, version log and licence log.$t59e$, $t59f$[{"criterion": "Critique used", "max_points": 40, "guidance": "Changes."}, {"criterion": "Licence log", "max_points": 40, "guidance": "Complete."}, {"criterion": "Reflection", "max_points": 20, "guidance": "Honest."}]$t59f$::jsonb, 20, 'text', false, false),
  (60, $t60a$Pro capstone 6: deliver the package$t60a$, $t60b$Deliver and present.$t60b$, $t60c$Deliver all files, usage guide, licence log and a client summary. Share in the Discord and ask for one piece of feedback.

